  "description": "Webtoon producer Dana lives a secret double life as a famous makeup YouTuber. That secret is threatened when her junior colleague, Seokjin, pitches a new webtoon series based on her very own channel. Terrified of being exposed after a disastrous live stream, Dana tries to probe his intentions over drinks, only to drunkenly confess everything. Seokjin seizes the chance, blackmailing her into co-producing the webtoon to protect her double life. But as they work side by side, their dangerous leverage turns into a subtle, undeniable spark. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
